  "id": "beef-stroganoff-568f4872",
  "name": "Beef Stroganoff",
  "subtitle": "Tender steak and mushrooms in a creamy paprika sauce",
  "description": "A rich skillet supper combining seared beef, mushrooms, porcini stock, and a tangy sour-cream sauce, served with mashed potatoes.",
  "meal_type": "other",
